add('L54–L59 vary rail/base height, tilt, stand-off and station positions;300-target maps include counter, sink, low-faucet approaches and appliance openings with carriage optimization and Jacobian dexterity. They retain the full151 mm shoulder cover and current elbow restriction. Maps omit movable fixtures, so they only propose seeds. L60–L65 replace bulky wash-cup handling, roll the full bok choy onto its70 mm grasp dimension and correct the cutter-lid withdrawal state. L67/L68 move full tool docks100 mm forward and compare rear/front vertical peeler lid positions. The last grasp/drain trial changes rigid tool frames and the colander route without shrinking geometry. Configurations with no numerical evidence are excluded from the six-iteration count. Exact same per-stroke scene/target searches may be reused with hashes and fresh positive replay; their starts are not falsely charged as new compute. [Iterations]('+link('results/iterations.csv')+'), [map data]('+link('results/reachability/')+'), [layout summary]('+link('results/layout_iterations_v5.json')+').')
add('L70 returns to the stronger L65 peeler/tool arrangement after the forward/vertical variants lost static reach and still failed the tested folds. L71 adds25 mm engagement/retreat to ten working templates, but its actual connection sweep exposed a wrong direction at the root brush: moving sideways along the tool approach left3 mm contact. L73 corrects five wash/wipe boundary poses to a25 mm lift along the horizontal work-face normal. These motions belong to the working stroke, retain the sourced loads and receive their own full internal replay. Every free connection strips working permission. The explicit grasp approach also plans to a50 mm pre-grasp and checks Cartesian insertion along the named axis, rather than expecting a random final RRT edge to find the narrow window.')
add('L72 tests a physical75° forward lock of the full bowl bail/key, with full-size pins/stops and40 g added mass per bowl, plus lower inlet grasp points with unchanged world food geometry. The original bowl/collar positions and every original solid dimension were checked. Its targeted searches did not recover a positive witness, so L73 retains the L71 hardware and the added bail mechanism is not charged to its cost. [Bail geometry validation]('+link('results/bail_geometry_validation_v5.json')+'). A fixed-carriage13-position grid was also added to collision-aware IK to escape flat face-distance gradients; these are new search proposals only, followed by the same full reference admission.')
